              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Endzone"
            },
            "reviewBody": "No, it's not Cincinnati chili. I was born and raised in Cincinnati, but it is good. It is a lot sweeter than Cincinnati chili. I used it as a chili dog sauce and it worked real good. I used it over spaghetti, and it was also good that way. I just left out the kidney beans because I wanted to use it as a chili dog sauce. I will make it again.",
